    ladderStatesLabel: 'Related states',
    extendedTitle: 'Extended stress responses (beyond fight/flight/freeze)',
    extendedIntro: 'Fight, flight, and freeze are the best-known stress responses — already covered by "fight", "flight", and "freeze" among the three main states above. "Fawn" and "collapse" are states you can also select in Access, but are grouped here among the extended patterns for a clearer overview — together with three more that go beyond the classic three responses:',
