    reflectionIntroText: 'This could be a protection strategy. It probably made sense at some point — the question is more whether it still helps you today the way you need it to.',
    reflectionProtectedQ: 'What might it have originally protected you from?',
    reflectionProtectedPlaceholder: 'e.g. overwhelm, rejection, loss of control …',
    reflectionCostsQ: 'What does it sometimes cost you today?',
